cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use VTAS in your research, please cite it as below."
title: "VTAS: Visual-Truth Alignment Score"
abstract: >-
  A reference-free, interpretable evaluation metric for Vision-Language
  Models that detects object hallucinations using a two-tier grounding
  pipeline (DETR + CLIP) and an F-beta scoring formulation.
type: software
authors:
